        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.82999999999998,
          "end": 225.183,
          "en": "because only in that case I wanna update my userPlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.04,
          "end": 228.57,
          "en": "And with that, we should make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.57,
          "end": 232.413,
          "en": "that we don't have duplicate places in our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 236.79,
          "en": "So now if I reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 236.79,
          "end": 239.28,
          "en": "and I try to add a place that's already part",
