          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.13,
          "end": 245.583,
          "en": "I can hammer it and it still doesn't show up down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.14,
          "end": 250.23,
          "en": "And with that, we improved this optimistic updating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 250.23,
          "end": 254.55,
          "en": "and we make sure that we don't update the UI in a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
